<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Treasury auction raises 215 mln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Treasury auction raises 215 mln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moroccan Treasury raised 215 million dirhams from its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank al-Maghrib (central bank) said on Friday.</p>
<p>Rates were unchanged and bids in million dirhams accepted as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY	BID	 AMOUNT	 INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    26 weeks	50	    50	     8.5  percent</p>
<p>    52 weeks	20	    20	     9.0  percent</p>
<p>    Five years   100	   100	    10.0  percent</p>
<p>    15 years	45	    45	    10.50 percent</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Total	  215	   215</p>
<p>($1= 8.6 dirhams)</p>
<p>- Rabat newsroom +212-7 726518</p>
</text>
